{
  "id": "pump_head_and_pressure__conversion__calculations__",
  "title": "Pump Head and Pressure: Conversion, Calculations, and Charts",
  "description": "Convert between pump head (feet/metres) and pressure (psi/bar/kg/cm²) using standard formulas. Includes calculations for converting head to pressure and vice versa, with support for different fluid densities using specific gravity.",
  "type": "datatable",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Pump Head and Pressure Conversion\n\nThis tool converts between pump head measurements and pressure units using specific gravity corrections.\n\n### Conversion Formulas:\n- **Head (ft) to Pressure (psi):** p = 0.433 × h × SG\n- **Head (m) to Pressure (bar):** p = 0.0981 × h × SG\n- **Head (m) to Pressure (kg/cm²):** p = 0.1 × h × SG\n- **Pressure (psi) to Head (ft):** h = 2.31 × p / SG\n- **Pressure (bar) to Head (m):** h = 10.197 × p / SG\n- **Pressure (kg/cm²) to Head (m):** h = 10 × p / SG"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "headers": [
        "Conversion Type",
        "Input",
        "Output"
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "conversion_type",
          "label": "Conversion Type",
          "type": "select",
          "options": [
            {
              "label": "Head (ft) to Pressure (psi)",
              "value": "ft_to_psi"
            },
            {
              "label": "Head (m) to Pressure (bar)",
              "value": "m_to_bar"
            },
            {
              "label": "Head (m) to Pressure (kg/cm²)",
              "value": "m_to_kgcm2"
            },
            {
              "label": "Pressure (psi) to Head (ft)",
              "value": "psi_to_ft"
            },
            {
              "label": "Pressure (bar) to Head (m)",
              "value": "bar_to_m"
            },
            {
              "label": "Pressure (kg/cm²) to Head (m)",
              "value": "kgcm2_to_m"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "input_value",
          "label": "Input Value",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 100,
          "unit": ""
        },
        {
          "id": "specific_gravity",
          "label": "Specific Gravity (SG)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 1,
          "unit": ""
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "result",
          "label": "Converted Value",
          "formula": "inputs.conversion_type === 'ft_to_psi' ? inputs.input_value * 0.433 * inputs.specific_gravity : inputs.conversion_type === 'm_to_bar' ? inputs.input_value * 0.0981 * inputs.specific_gravity : inputs.conversion_type === 'm_to_kgcm2' ? inputs.input_value * 0.1 * inputs.specific_gravity : inputs.conversion_type === 'psi_to_ft' ? (2.31 * inputs.input_value) / inputs.specific_gravity : inputs.conversion_type === 'bar_to_m' ? (10.197 * inputs.input_value) / inputs.specific_gravity : (10 * inputs.input_value) / inputs.specific_gravity",
          "format": "decimal",
          "unit": ""
        }
      ]
    },
